# Colossus of the Strait - the quest "The Giant's Heart" played through (plan Relic of the Seventh Tide, island 6)
# The gear wheel takes the three gears of the earlier islands; on its own the test fetches them from those islands'
# chests first (the Sarcophagus, the mast cabin strongbox, the Fang's altar). Headlands at 5 m, the giant's chest
# chamber floor at 18.3, its roof at 22.4. The heel room's door at -25.5 0, the lift inside.
island Sandsunk Necropolis
open Sarcophagus
expect story gear1 1
island Skyhook Mast
open Mast cabin strongbox
expect story gear2 1
island The Hollow Fang
open Altar
expect story gear3 1
include colossus_of_the_strait_body.play
